# Typescript Codegen for Arrow

This directory contains typescript code generation related files.

## Setup

Install `ts<|fim_suffix|>nager` and `@babel/core` using yarn:

```sh
yarn add @babel/types babel-generator
```

Or use npm install:

```sh
npm i --save-dev @babel/types babel-generator
```
